    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bariinyeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara dabaloola ghuusiga fuga muunda ng'eanyiida ea dea malaykajeega, nea meandeawani bariinyeega, abeeda ea naahuuyi gharinyeanda ajuuri ea deebajeanda was moongeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eara dandeawa uurda sibaneanduumeeda, ak ghaanali makcheamuutka sean bea fughareeda, ak geandeawi masaweega sean, ammu goobaleak giijeega, ak ea meandeawani bariinyeega, meawoosi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyaadaydi haleanjeedeanyu sean eandeawi, ama aadaydi saseedeanyu eaghwarda, ak ea meandeawani bariinyeega, ea meanyasi gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bariinyeega iissa ghamilikghta nea inya jih; bariinyeega mandeawana lachng'eanyiida ghana ghwarjeeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea maba ghunduufka ghana ghwarjeeda. Bariinyeega ea masiga naweadaanyi nea gaba geaw; ak ea mii asas nyaras ghana gwandeawa sicheeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea mahoosaniisiina ng'asheega munyas, iissa gahoosasa ng'asheega doobiiweadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bariinyeega iissa ghamilikghta ng'asheega sean, ak ghamwas ng'asheega sean, ak ghwarar ng'asheega sean ak ghwarjeang'da aba ng'asheega sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bariinyeega manda muudeanooda; nea iimida ramooranga gayghang'ata; gwasunu eara iita eemoojiga, gaygamuudean, ama mida fughareeda gayghang'ata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fughareangaasa iissa ea mwahita nea eara ramoorangaasa ea mwahita; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwahidu gidida hidaadiin, abeeda gayghang'ata gidida mii hidaadiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi nea gutawoos baleanda, iissa geabalooldi baleanda, ak geateemsheati baleanda, ak gwadeena fughareedeanyu dea baleanda; hean nea geeheedu doaw ng'eedeeda, ghaanung'waadi ng'asheega jeepcheanduumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghamneawa geeng'uli geat giyoo aba jeeda misaneeda, nea damandida gaygwaroonyi gheanyangaasa. Asi ghamneawa ghaanali aba meatkweenagi; damandida gaydanal muuchi, aba gideaba ASEETA ghwanalan muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi masaweega ea ghusooda ea bariinyeega, ng'asheesu asamwaguun, aba jeedeaba ng'asheesu daahaw muuchi bariinyeega gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
